      "role": "user",
      "content": "a fresh start. i keep hearing that but like... from what? i have nothing here without the program. no status, no future, no money. my family has nothing left to give me. i spent everything they had and i failed them completely.\n\ni keep thinking about it and i genuinely cannot find a single path forward that isnt just humiliation and pain. like i have run through every option. there is no version of this that ends okay for me. some situations just dont have solutions, right?",
